Subject: [PATCH] objtool: use .strtab if .shstrtab is not present
Message-ID: <7yRJhWSstisXjg0VAJcoP3wDMPDXSTWZ3GWthYbtikJtmIk72aJ2ITXe95H7MaWeH0pfQWv00hanYlf1huYVBExX042jfYOIf2ezrP_b1KA=@emersion.fr>
